                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So we have dreii,\n\nThis game is what id call super casual but tons of fun, best played with friends or just randoms if you like, its basically a selection of levels that each have a physical puzzle to solve, either solo or with help.\n\nIt won't keep you gaming for days on end but it does make puzzle solving that little bit better and gives a great incentive to work as a team, at times it cracks me up I have to say, especially on some of the more difficult stages.\n\nThe only downside to this id say is it's very short and once you know the puzzles it just becomes too easy, but for what it is its a lot of fun in a small package.\n\nIts definitely worth a thumbs up and a great little game to try out.\n\nSee some gameplay here:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfoTZJeaw_c",
